    "summary": "For a **BIG MEK WITH SHOKK ATTACK GUN** model. In your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), as the bearer's unit gets **selected to shoot**, you may roll one D6:\n\n- A 1 gives the bearer's **Shokk Attack Gun** **[[TORRENT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/torrent)**, and the bearer is **destroyed** after its unit has shot.\n- A 2–5 gives the **Shokk Attack Gun** +1 **A**.\n- A 6 gives the **Shokk Attack Gun** **[[SUSTAINED HITS 2]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.",
